    "Cleaned task workspaces are not reconstructed or freshly certified. Source/control outcomes remain historical attestations from the bound validator; raw command events and billing receipts are rechecked.",
    "Unknown and partial usage remain incomplete. Observed totals are lower bounds when any usage is unavailable.",
    "The 48M threshold stops new calls based on observed usage; concurrent in-flight calls may overshoot it. Historical unknown usage remains unknown.",
    "Original cohort costs are already part of the shared ledger. Do not add the original audit subtotal again; prior trials and authoring remain separate.",
    "Observed task samples are descriptive and separate from native final acceptance. A phase interrupted by the budget can leave completed samples while native comparison rows remain empty.",
    "Sample medians include only complete solver usage receipts, including failed task samples; incomplete observed costs stay in billing and are excluded from these distributions.",
    "Per-task sample comparisons require all planned repetitions to be finalized, correct and metered on both sides. A descriptive comparison for one complete group never changes an incomplete or budget-exhausted overall verdict."
